<title>USA: Summa Four names Jeffrey Weber CFO.</title>
<headline>Summa Four names Jeffrey Weber CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, N.H. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summa Four Inc said Tuesday it named Jeffrey Weber, replacing Thomas St. Germain, who is retiring.</p>
<p>Summa provies switching platforms for the telecommunications industry.  </p>
<p>Before joining Summa, Weber was chief financial officer of Robotic Vision Systems Inc's CI Matrix unit.</p>
